{"asset_key":"timeline/quest_story_17207290","episode":"timeline","category":"quest_story","story_id":"17207290","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"cinematic_dialogue:2:1720728001:":{"text":"お金がないなら帰ってください！","source_cn":"没钱就下次再来吧","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE38E789132DA7031","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:2:1720728002:":{"text":"無礼だ！本当に無礼だ！","source_cn":"粗鲁！真是粗鲁！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x836882FB8D379B48","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:2:1720728003:":{"text":"すごく上手！","source_cn":"真好听！<key:dialog1>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD91F87BB0DFC198D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:2:1720728004:":{"text":"拍手拍手！","source_cn":"鼓掌鼓掌！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x81668F2F8DC2B6A6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:2:1720728005:":{"text":"最高だったわ！","source_cn":"太精彩了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x64D07C42A84C2947","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:2:1720728006:":{"text":"素敵な歌をありがとう！","source_cn":"谢谢你的表演！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA4AA60ADEAE66043","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1720729001:0":{"text":"あの人、吟遊詩人よね？彼もお腹を空かせてるのかしら……だったら助けてあげないと！","source_cn":"那是个吟游诗人吧？他是不是也饿着肚子？我们能不能帮帮他？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA5B8655F1A15165F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1720729002:0":{"text":"ぺ……ペペお嬢様、ちょっと待って。助けるにしても年上だよ。大人のプライドってもんがあるだろうし……","source_cn":"佩……佩小姐，等等。帮忙也得讲究方法，成年人的自尊心，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB9F9A765AEBC6772","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1720729003:0":{"text":"分かってるわよ！私がどれほど礼儀作法の稽古を積まされてると思ってるの！黙って見てなさい！","source_cn":"我知道！我会很礼貌地提供帮助的。看我的吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2D76B50C6AEABCB8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1720729004:0":{"text":"ペギーは深く息を吸い込み、前へと歩み出した――","source_cn":"佩吉深吸了一口气，走上前去——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFAF5E87358EEF427","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1720729005:0":{"text":"無礼だ！無礼にもほどがある！美酒は歌や音楽とともにあるべきで、カネの匂いなどその場を汚すだけだ！","source_cn":"粗鲁！真是粗鲁！美酒应当搭配音乐和诗歌，而不是铜臭味！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x201AFCC5EBFCBB27","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1720729006:0":{"text":"そ、そこの紳士様……少々お時間をよろしいですか？","source_cn":"这位先生，请留步。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB22DE23DB93937A6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1720729007:0":{"text":"私はあなたの才能を尊敬しています。もしご迷惑でなければ、ええ……お酒代を払わせていただけませんか？その……芸術のためということで……","source_cn":"我、我很欣赏您的才华，如果您不介意的话，我想替您支付酒...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB5049BBD7D69B49D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1720729008:0":{"text":"君がお酒代を？芸術のため？","source_cn":"替我付钱？为了艺术？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC57F417164CD630C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1720729009:0":{"text":"お嬢さん……それは芸術への敬意などではなく、ただの憐みから言ってるよね？それくらい僕にも分かるよ。","source_cn":"小姑娘，你的礼仪无可挑剔，但我听得出来，你的举动只不过...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x24BB5CEAD27720E4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1720729010:0":{"text":"えっ？いや……そんなことは……","source_cn":"哎？我……我没有……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0DBA37C20F2B95AB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1720729011:0":{"text":"どんなに体裁よく飾り立ててくれても、僕の才能に施しなど必要ない。","source_cn":"收起你的好意吧。我的才华不需要施舍，哪怕是包装得再精美...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF584F26A8F2666FB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1720729012:0":{"text":"もし本当に僕の才能を認めるというのなら、この場で僕の歌を聴いてほしい。","source_cn":"如果你真的欣赏我的才华，就该安静地站在这里，听我唱完这首歌。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xED1582DF1CD46CCD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1720729013:0":{"text":"もしそれで君の心を動かせたなら、その対価としてありがたく金貨を頂くよ。もし動かせなかったら、遠慮なくこの場を立ち去ってほしい。","source_cn":"要是我的歌声打动了你，我很欢迎你把那枚该死的金币放进我...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x900C4204C3EF7996","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1720729014:0":{"text":"歌ってもいないのにお金を押し付けられるなんて、吟遊詩人としての僕のプライドが許さない。","source_cn":"那才是一个吟游诗人应得的尊严，而不是像现在这样，还没开...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x994E288FC07F4EE0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1720729015:0":{"text":"ご……ごめんなさい。ただ、力になれればと思って……","source_cn":"对……对不起。我只是想帮忙……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x07A994FECBD2B7AE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1720729016:0":{"text":"それなら耳を澄ませてよく聴いてほしい。いま目の前で歌うのは、サバンナ随一の吟遊詩人なんだからね！","source_cn":"想帮忙？那就竖起耳朵认真听吧。这可是全赛凡纳最好的吟游...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x29C189A43318F576","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:25:1720728001:":{"text":"お金がないなら帰ってください！","source_cn":"没钱就下次再来吧","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE38E789132DA7031","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:25:1720728002:":{"text":"無礼だ！本当に無礼だ！","source_cn":"粗鲁！真是粗鲁！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x836882FB8D379B48","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:25:1720728003:":{"text":"すごく上手！","source_cn":"真好听！<key:dialog1>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD91F87BB0DFC198D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:25:1720728004:":{"text":"拍手拍手！","source_cn":"鼓掌鼓掌！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x81668F2F8DC2B6A6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:25:1720728005:":{"text":"最高だったわ！","source_cn":"太精彩了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x64D07C42A84C2947","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:25:1720728006:":{"text":"素敵な歌をありがとう！","source_cn":"谢谢你的表演！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA4AA60ADEAE66043","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1720729017:0":{"text":"……彼は遙か千里の村を発つ、古びたリュートを櫂（かい ）のごとく携えて……","source_cn":"……他从千里之外的村庄启程，一把旧琴是他的舟桨……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE1E6FC4C0F03DEFA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1720729018:0":{"text":"……辿り着いたのは絢爛たる王都、夢に描きし故郷と思いて……","source_cn":"……他来到了纸醉金迷的王都，以为这里是梦中的故乡……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x44029EFDA77AB8DF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1720729019:0":{"text":"……人の流れは川のようで、彼の歌に耳を傾ける者はなく……","source_cn":"……人群流水般匆匆经过，没有人驻足听他歌唱……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x31F7E1FC25E7C683","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:30:1720729020:0":{"text":"……人の流れは川のようで、風と鳥だけが聴いている……","source_cn":"……人群流水般迢迢路过，风和鸟儿在听他唱歌……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAEBD20DAB66B639B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:31:1720729021:0":{"text":"……風はやさしく彼に寄り添い、鳥はさえずり彼に応える……","source_cn":"……风儿为他温柔地停留，鸟儿为了他鸣鸣啾啾……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x954E30D23C2BA225","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:32:1720729022:0":{"text":"……若き吟遊詩人よ憂うなかれ、弦の絶えぬかぎり歌は尽きない……","source_cn":"……年轻的吟游诗人啊，不要忧伤，只要琴弦未断……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFCBB41F7D3B80B8E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:33:1720729023:0":{"text":"……ゆえに今は、ただ自由のままに歩め……","source_cn":"……就暂且享受这自由的流浪……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBD7BBD4001EC137E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:34:1720729024:0":{"text":"一曲を歌い終え――","source_cn":"一曲表演结束后——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA4BE153D793083F0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:37:1720728001:":{"text":"お金がないなら帰ってください！","source_cn":"没钱就下次再来吧","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE38E789132DA7031","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_femal